su name replacements be map def
  su text "[[source]]" ob name text replacement source ya
  su text "[[intent]]" ob name text replacement intent ya
  su text "[[points]]" ob name text replacement points ya
  su text "[[access]]" ob name text replacement access ya
  su text "[[format]]" ob name text replacement format ya
  su text "[[feedback]]" ob name text replacement feedback ya
  su text "[[draft]]" ob name text replacement draft ya
prah

su name verdict from text review to name text pass be ceremony def
  su name review stage ob text of from of this to name text review be text do
  ob text "false" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text review from text "/\\bPASS\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text pass be equally from text false then
  su name verdict request begin stage ob text "VERIFIER_ANALYSIS:\n" to name text verdict request be text do
  ob name text review to name text verdict request be plus do
  ob name text verdict request for name news verdict mind to name text verdict raw by num 0 atmost num 8 be write do
  ob name text verdict raw atmost num 1 to name text verdict line be line tail do
  ob name text verdict line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "true" to name text pass be text do
  ob name text verdict line from text "/^\\s*FAIL\\b/i" be resemble then
  ob text "false" to name text pass be text do
  su name pass ret
prah

su name format checked to name text output be ceremony def
  ob name text request for name news format mind to name text format raw by num 0 atmost num 8 be write do
  ob text "" to name text output be text do
  ob name text format raw from text "/^\\s*chirp manuscript\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "chirp manuscript" to name text output be text do
  ob name text format raw from text "/^\\s*brief manuscript\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "brief manuscript" to name text output be text do
  ob name text format raw from text "/^\\s*news article\\s*$/i" be resemble then
  ob text "news article" to name text output be text do
  ob name text output be equally from text "" then
  su name format guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "news format defective" be guarantee do
  su name output ret
prah

su name fit to name text pass be ceremony def
  ob name text drafttext to name text replacement draft be text do
  su name request stage ob name map replacements in name text fit request template to name text request be instead do
  su name review stage ob name text request for name news fit verify mind to name text review by num 0 atmost num 220 be write do
  su name verdict stage from text of ob of review to name text pass be verdict do
  su name pass ret
prah

su name fairness to name text pass be ceremony def
  ob name text source text to name text replacement source be text do
  ob name text drafttext to name text replacement draft be text do
  su name request stage ob name map replacements in name text fairness request template to name text request be instead do
  su name review stage ob name text request for name news fairness verify mind to name text review by num 0 atmost num 220 be write do
  su name verdict stage from text of ob of review to name text pass be verdict do
  su name pass ret
prah

su name story retry fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be ceremony def
  ob name text story pass be equally from text true then be depart do
  ob text quoted.text.Shorten and simplify. Put the most important verified point first. Remove repeated wording. Keep only facts directly supported by the source. If this is an agenda, make the preview language clearly upcoming, not completed..text.quoted to name text replacement feedback be text do
  ob name text format be equally from text "chirp manuscript" then
  ob text quoted.text.Rewrite as one compact civic chirp manuscript between 100 and 220 characters. Keep only one dominant point plus one practical reason to care..text.quoted to name text replacement feedback be text do
  ob name text format be equally from text "brief manuscript" then
  ob text quoted.text.Rewrite as three short paragraphs totaling 90 to 160 words. Keep the top two to four distinct points only, then end with why it matters or how to follow..text.quoted to name text replacement feedback be text do
  ob name text format be equally from text "news article" then
  ob text quoted.text.Rewrite as a short local news article with one headline line and three short paragraphs. Keep 180 to 320 words. Use the strongest verified items first and avoid repeating them later..text.quoted to name text replacement feedback be text do
  su name draft request retry stage ob name map replacements in name text draft request template to name text draft request be instead do
  su name draft retry stage ob name text draft request for name news draft mind to name text drafttext by num 0 atmost num 320 be write do
  su name letters retry stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 100 atmost num 2400 from name text drafttext to name map letters verify do
  ob text of pass of letters verify to name text letters pass be text do
  su name fit retry stage to name text fit pass be fit do
  su name fairness retry stage to name text fairness pass be fairness do
  ob text "true" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text fit pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text fairness pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
prah

su name news manuscript run be refinery def
  su name source stage from filename of ob of source become wo text to name text source text be read do
  exists su name source clean cmd ob text "cat -- \"" be text ya
  ob filename of source to name text source focus input be text do
  ob name source focus input to name source clean cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" | awk 'BEGIN{IGNORECASE=1} { line=$0; if (index(line, \"This item has\") == 1) next; if (match(line, \"^[[:space:]]*[0-9]+[a-z]?\\\\.?[[:space:]]*$\")) next; if (match(line, \"^[[:space:]]*$\")) next; sub(\"^[[:space:]]+\", \"\", line); sub(\"[[:space:]]+$\", \"\", line); if (NR <= 5) { print line; next } if (index(line, \"livestream\") > 0 || index(line, \"Rogers\") > 0 || index(line, \"one business day\") > 0 || index(line, \"comments\") > 0 || index(line, \"Council Chambers\") > 0 || index(line, \"Public Forum\") > 0 || index(line, \"Re: \") > 0 || index(line, \"By-law\") > 0 || index(line, \"Notice of Motion\") > 0 || index(line, \"Award\") > 0 || index(line, \"Tender\") > 0 || index(line, \"Transit\") > 0 || index(line, \"Funding Agreement\") > 0 || index(line, \"Design-Build\") > 0 || index(line, \"Build Canada Homes\") > 0 || index(line, \"Response Time\") > 0 || index(line, \"Grant\") > 0 || index(line, \"Business Licences\") > 0 || index(line, \"Municipal Road Transfers\") > 0 || index(line, \"Zoning By-law Update\") > 0 || index(line, \"Hazardous and Special Product\") > 0 || index(line, \"$\") > 0 || (index(line, \"That \") == 1 && (index(line, \"report\") > 0 || index(line, \"award\") > 0 || index(line, \"prepare\") > 0 || index(line, \"proceed\") > 0 || index(line, \"fund\") > 0 || index(line, \"submitted\") > 0 || index(line, \"support\") > 0 || index(line, \"received\") > 0))) print line }'" to name source clean cmd be plus do
  su name source clean stage ob text of source clean cmd to name text source cleaned be command do
  ob name text news intent to name text replacement intent be text do

  su name source abridge stage from name text source cleaned atmost byte 8000 to name text source abridged be abridge do
  ob name text source abridged to name text replacement source be text do

  su name points request stage ob name map replacements in name text points request template to name text points request be instead do
  su name points draft stage ob name text points request for name news points mind to name text points raw by num 0 atmost num 220 be write do
  ob name text points raw to name text replacement points be text do

  su name points sieve request stage ob name map replacements in name text points sieve request template to name text points sieve request be instead do
  su name points sieve stage ob name text points sieve request for name news points sieve mind to name text points kept by num 0 atmost num 220 be write do
  ob name text points kept to name text replacement points be text do

  su name points guarantee stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 20 atmost num 900 from name text points kept to name map points letters verify do
  ob text of pass of points letters verify to name text points pass be text do
  ob name text points pass be equally from text false then
  su name points abort stage ob bool lie fromtext text "news points defective" be guarantee do

  su name access request stage ob name map replacements in name text points request template to name text access request be instead do
  su name access stage ob name text access request for name news access mind to name text access kept by num 0 atmost num 120 be write do
  ob name text access kept to name text replacement access be text do

  su name format request stage ob name map replacements in name text format request template to name text request be instead do
  su name format stage to name text format be format checked do
  ob name text format to name text replacement format be text do

  su name draft request stage ob name map replacements in name text draft request template to name text draft request be instead do
  su name draft stage ob name text draft request for name news draft mind to name text drafttext by num 0 atmost num 320 be write do

  su name letters stage be verify as wo letter count atleast num 100 atmost num 2400 from name text drafttext to name map letters verify do
  ob text of pass of letters verify to name text letters pass be text do
  su name fit stage to name text fit pass be fit do
  su name fairness stage to name text fairness pass be fairness do
  ob text "true" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text letters pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text fit pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text fairness pass be equally from text false then
  ob text "false" to name text story pass be text do
  ob name text story pass be equally from text false then
  fromindex num 1 toindex num 3 be story retry do
  ob name text story pass be equally from text false then
  su name article guarantee stage ob bool lie fromtext text "news article defective" be guarantee do
  ob name text drafttext be write do
prah

from name news manuscript run to name text result be refinery do
ob name result be write do
